{"id":"00062","root":"uni00062_1","name":{"ja":"セシリア・チェロ","en":"Cecilia Cello"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"セシリア・チェロ","en":"Cecilia Cello"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-11-16","limited":false,"characterId":55,"profile":{"ja":"米連の研究所で生まれた女の子。遺伝子操作により人工的に作られた彼女は生まれつき強力な魔力を扱える。また米連の研究者たちから英才教育を受けさせられて育ち、学力や身体能力はずば抜けている。能力を使い、生命無きモノに魔力を与えて操り敵を殲滅させることができるが、操っている間に魔力を激しく消耗してしまうのが欠点で、かばんやポシェットには甘いお菓子をたくさん常備している。自由気ままで抜けたところがある性格。","en":"Cecilia Cello was born in a United Nations research facility. Created artificially through genetic engineering, she innately wields powerful magical energy. Raised under the gifted-education program of United Nations researchers, her academic and physical abilities are exceptional. She can use her magic to imbue lifeless objects with power and command them to annihilate foes, though doing so rapidly drains her mana. For that reason, her bag and satchel are always stocked with plenty of sweet snacks. She has a carefree, slightly absent-minded personality."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"民安ともえ","forms":[{"id":"uni00062_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1048,2096],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[130,260],"def":[114,228],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","50004"]},{"id":"uni00062_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1596,3192],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[195,390],"def":[163,326],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","50004","50005"]},{"id":"uni00062_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2144,4289],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[265,529],"def":[217,435],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","50004","50005"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属