 huh~"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"ダメダメ！　このお菓子はセシリアのだから絶対にあげないよ！","en":"No no! This candy is Cecilia's so I'll never give it away!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"さっきからジッとおっぱい見てどうしたの？　わかった、ミルクキャンディ食べたいんでしょ♪","en":"You've been staring at my chest the whole time, what's up? I get it, you want a milk candy♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"チョコレート大好き！　ケーキも飴も、お菓子ならなんでも大好き♪","en":"I love chocolate! I love cake, candy—any sweet, I love it!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"ねえねえお菓子持ってるでしょ？　いいなあ、ちょうだいちょうだい♪","en":"Hey hey, you have snacks, right? So nice, give me give me~"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"セシリアだよ！　えっと、人口生命体なんだけど、そんなことよりお菓子が欲しいな、持ってない？","en":"It's Cecilia! Um, I'm an artificial lifeform, but more than that I want sweets—got any?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"うう、魔力を使うとお腹ぺこぺこで力が出なくなっちゃう……お願い、甘いお菓子頂戴！","en":"Ugh, using magic makes my stomach rumble and I lose power... Please, give me some sweet snacks!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00062_1/uni00062_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voic